cancellation.body:
Dear Sir or Madam,

I hereby cancel the following contract {{effective_clause}}:

{{contract_name}}
{{reference_label}}: {{reference}}
Contract holder: {{holder_name}}

Please confirm in writing that you have received this cancellation and the date the contract ends. I do not agree to any renewal of the contract.

Any direct debit authorisation I have given you ends when the contract ends.

Yours faithfully,


{{sender_name}}{{signature_note}}
